		(property "Description" "The ball seat of ErgoCai.modules trackball/PMW3610-pogo (cup/cup.js --fix cartridge --style seat --support 2 --ball 20, 3D printed) with its 20 mm ball and six 2 mm PTFE balls (three supports, three holding it down) in place, for the 3D view only: no copper, nothing in the BOM. A cartridge as joystick/Alpsalpine-pogo's retainer: the seat one print with a frame round the board, whose two arms snap under the case's top layer, and a printed base under the board (3.8 mm spacers, spigots into the mount's holes), screwed together through the board's corner holes; the module goes on the mount turned half a turn. Origin on the ball's axis, the sensor's optical centre; the model is cup.js --step (the seat, its frame and the base), for the lens's reference plane 4.35 mm over a 1.6 mm board."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "465a63ec-3bab-4c62-ad36-dcda6e3424b7")
			(effects
